---
import { withBase } from '../../utils/paths';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';


---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About the Distributed Systems and Security Laboratory at CUNY, directed by Professor Saptarshi Debroy."
>

  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">

      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">About DiSSect</p>

        <h1>
          A lab for systems that must{' '}
          <span class="line muted">work beyond ideal conditions.</span>
        </h1>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-side">
        <p>
          The Distributed Systems and Security Laboratory studies
          intelligent, distributed, and trustworthy computing systems
          designed to operate under real-world performance, resource,
          reliability, and security constraints.
        </p>

        <div class="identity">
          <span>DiSSect Lab</span>
          <strong>CUNY · New York</strong>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mission-section">
    <div class="container mission-grid">

      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Our Mission</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mission-copy">
        <p>
          Computing increasingly happens across
          <strong>
            devices, networks, edge infrastructure, cloud platforms,
            datacenters, and intelligent services.
          </strong>
          DiSSect studies how those systems can remain responsive,
          efficient, resilient, and secure as they become more distributed
          and more complex.
        </p>

        <p>
          The lab combines systems research, networking, machine learning,
          security, and experimental evaluation to develop mechanisms that
          can operate under practical constraints rather than assuming
          perfect infrastructure or ideal environments.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="identity-section">
    <div class="container">

      <header class="section-header">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Research Identity</p>

          <h2>
            Distributed systems and security,{' '}
            <span class="muted">viewed as one connected problem.</span>
          </h2>
        </div>

        <p>
          Performance, trust, security, and intelligence increasingly
          interact across the same infrastructure. DiSSect studies those
          interactions rather than treating them as isolated concerns.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="identity-grid">

        <article>
          <span class="number">01</span>
          <h3>Distributed</h3>
          <p>
            Computation spans heterogeneous devices, edge resources,
            cloud infrastructure, and network domains.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <span class="number">02</span>
          <h3>Intelligent</h3>
          <p>
            Machine learning and adaptive decision-making increasingly
            determine how modern systems allocate resources and respond.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <span class="number">03</span>
          <h3>Trustworthy</h3>
          <p>
            Systems must preserve dependable behavior despite uncertainty,
            failures, changing conditions, and imperfect infrastructure.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <span class="number">04</span>
          <h3>Secure</h3>
          <p>
            Programmable and collaborative systems create new attack
            surfaces that require security to be considered by design.
          </p>
        </article>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="evolution-section">
    <div class="container">

      <header class="evolution-header">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Research Evolution</p>

          <h2>
            A research program shaped{' '}
            <span class="muted">by changing infrastructure.</span>
          </h2>
        </div>

        <p>
          DiSSect's work has evolved alongside computing infrastructure,
          while maintaining a consistent focus on distributed behavior,
          resource management, resilience, and security.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="timeline">

        <article class="timeline-row">
          <span class="timeline-number">01</span>

          <div class="timeline-title">
            <h3>Networks &amp; Resource Management</h3>
          </div>

          <p>
            Early work examined wireless and networked systems,
            resource allocation, measurement, and performance.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-row">
          <span class="timeline-number">02</span>

          <div class="timeline-title">
            <h3>Cloud &amp; Cyberinfrastructure</h3>
          </div>

          <p>
            The research expanded toward distributed workflows,
            Science DMZ environments, cloud systems, and end-to-end
            performance and security assurance.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-row">
          <span class="timeline-number">03</span>

          <div class="timeline-title">
            <h3>Edge, Fog &amp; Resilience</h3>
          </div>

          <p>
            Edge and fog computing introduced new work around
            disaster response, heterogeneous resources, and resilient
            distributed computation.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="timeline-row">
          <span class="timeline-number">04</span>

          <div class="timeline-title">
            <h3>Trustworthy Intelligent Systems</h3>
          </div>

          <p>
            Current work increasingly connects intelligent edge systems,
            distributed AI, trustworthy computing, privacy, and security.
          </p>
        </article>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pi-section">
    <div class="container pi-grid">

      <div class="pi-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">Lab Director</p>

        <h2>Saptarshi Debroy</h2>

        <p class="role">
          Associate Professor of Computer Science
        </p>

        <p class="affiliation">
          Hunter College<br />
          Doctoral Faculty, The Graduate Center<br />
          City University of New York
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pi-copy">
        <p>
          Professor Debroy founded and directs the Distributed Systems
          and Security Laboratory at CUNY. His research spans distributed
          computing, edge and cloud systems, trustworthy computing,
          cyberinfrastructure security, networking, and related
          data-driven system-management problems.
        </p>

        <div class="pi-links">
          <a
            href="https://www.cs.hunter.cuny.edu/~sdebroy/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            Faculty page ↗
          </a>

          <a
            href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=z1Lr_cUAAAAJ&hl=en"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            Google Scholar ↗
          </a>

          <a href={withBase('/people/')}>
            Lab members →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="affiliation-section">
    <div class="container affiliation-grid">

      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Academic Home</p>

        <h2>
          Hunter College{' '}
          <span class="muted">&amp; The Graduate Center.</span>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="affiliation-details">
        <div>
          <span>University</span>
          <strong>City University of New York</strong>
        </div>

        <div>
          <span>Location</span>
          <strong>New York, NY</strong>
        </div>

        <div>
          <span>Discipline</span>
          <strong>Computer Science</strong>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-bridge">
    <div class="container bridge-grid">

      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Explore DiSSect</p>

        <h2>
          From lab identity{' '}
          <span class="muted">to research in action.</span>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="bridge-links">
        <a href={withBase('/research/')}>
          Research{' '}
          <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>

        <a href={withBase('/projects/')}>
          Projects{' '}
          <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>

        <a href={withBase('/publications/')}>
          Publications{' '}
          <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>

        <a href={withBase('/join/')}>
          Join Us{' '}
          <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-hero {
    padding-block: var(--space-hero-y);
    background: var(--color-bg);
  }

  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.3fr) minmax(300px, 0.55fr);
    gap: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 10rem);
    align-items: end;
  }

  .about-hero .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 1050px;
    font-size: var(--text-page-hero);
    font-weight: 760;
    line-height: var(--leading-display);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-display);
  }

  .line {
    display: block;
  }

  .muted {
    color: var(--color-text-soft);
  }

  .hero-side > p {
    color: var(--color-text-soft);
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.5vw, 1.25rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .identity {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong);
  }

  .identity span {
    color: var(--color-text-faint);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .identity strong {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
  }

  .mission-section {
    background: #17191e;
    color: white;
    padding-block: var(--space-section-y);
  }

  .mission-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 220px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 9rem);
  }

  .mission-section .eyebrow {
    color: #91a7ff;
  }

  .mission-copy {
    max-width: 1100px;
  }

  .mission-copy p {
    color: #aeb3bc;
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 3.2rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .mission-copy strong {
    color: white;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .mission-copy p + p {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .identity-section {
    background: #f4f5f7;
    padding-block: var(--space-section-y);
  }

  .section-header,
  .evolution-header {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(280px, 0.55fr);
    gap: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 9rem);
    align-items: end;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-section-heading);
  }

  .section-header .eyebrow,
  .evolution-header .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .section-header h2,
  .evolution-header h2 {
    max-width: 900px;
    font-size: var(--text-section-xl);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 0.98;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
  }

  .section-header > p,
  .evolution-header > p {
    color: var(--color-text-soft);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .identity-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong);
  }

  .identity-grid article {
    min-height: 300px;
    padding: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    border-right: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong);
  }

  .number,
  .timeline-number {
    color: var(--color-text-faint);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
  }

  .identity-grid h3 {
    margin-top: 5rem;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.6vw, 3.8rem);
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
  }

  .identity-grid p {
    max-width: 520px;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text-soft);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .evolution-section {
    background: var(--color-bg);
    padding-block: var(--space-section-y);
  }

  .timeline {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong);
  }

  .timeline-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 60px minmax(280px, 0.75fr) minmax(300px, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 6rem);
    padding-block: 2.75rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong);
  }

  .timeline-title h3 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 650;
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
  }

  .timeline-row > p {
    color: var(--color-text-soft);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .pi-section {
    background: #e8ecf3;
    padding-block: var(--space-section-y);
  }

  .pi-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(320px, 0.8fr) minmax(350px, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(4rem, 10vw, 11rem);
  }

  .pi-section .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .pi-intro h2 {
    font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 6vw, 6.3rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: var(--leading-display);
    letter-spacing: -0.065em;
  }

  .role {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .affiliation {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--color-text-soft);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .pi-copy {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong);
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .pi-copy > p {
    color: var(--color-text-soft);
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 1.8vw, 1.4rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .pi-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .pi-links a {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-text);
    padding-bottom: 0.25rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .affiliation-section {
    background: var(--color-bg);
    padding-block: var(--space-section-y);
  }

  .affiliation-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(320px, 0.7fr);
    gap: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 9rem);
    align-items: end;
  }

  .affiliation-section .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .affiliation-section h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-section-xl);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 0.97;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
  }

  .affiliation-details {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong);
  }

  .affiliation-details > div {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 2rem;
    padding-block: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong);
  }

  .affiliation-details span {
    color: var(--color-text-faint);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .affiliation-details strong {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .about-bridge {
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: white;
    padding-block: var(--space-section-y);
  }

  .bridge-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(300px, 0.65fr);
    gap: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 9rem);
    align-items: end;
  }

  .about-bridge .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    color: #c7d2fe;
  }

  .about-bridge h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-section-xl);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 0.96;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
  }

  .about-bridge .muted {
    color: #b9c8ff;
  }

  .bridge-links {
    border-top: 1px solid #6f8df5;
  }

  .bridge-links a {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding-block: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #6f8df5;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero-grid,
    .section-header,
    .evolution-header,
    .pi-grid,
    .affiliation-grid,
    .bridge-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .mission-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .identity-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .timeline-row {
      grid-template-columns: 40px minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .timeline-row > p {
      grid-column: 2;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .about-hero {
      padding-block: 5rem 6rem;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(3.4rem, 15vw, 5rem);
    }

    .timeline-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .timeline-row > p {
      grid-column: 1;
    }

    .affiliation-details > div {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.35rem;
    }

    .affiliation-details strong {
      text-align: left;
    }
  }
</style>
